   "section": "b4-about",
   "items": [
    {
     "role": "heading",
     "order": 0,
     "text": "About 4brands Reply"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 1,
     "text": "As an experienced partner for consumer goods companies, we combine analysis, consulting, and system integration into a holistic approach. With our comprehensive SAP expertise and innovative, data-driven technologies, we create seamless and flexible end-to-end processes that future-proof your business."
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 2,
     "text": "Our service portfolio goes beyond modern Data and CX solutions to include integrated planning in all its facets – from corporate and demand planning to account and promotion planning. As part of the Reply Group, we also leverage our deep AI expertise to optimize your processes, always with the goal of strengthening your brand and delivering an outstanding customer experience."
    }
   ],
