  {
   "section": "b4-band",
   "items": [
    {
     "role": "eyebrow",
     "order": 0,
     "text": "Case Study"
    },
    {
     "role": "cta",
     "order": 1,
     "text": "Rotkäppchen-Mumm manages sales and retail execution from a single platform",
     "href": "/en/retail-and-consumer-products/sales-and-retail-execution-platform"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 2,
     "text": "A central sales platform connects customer and product data, campaigns, field sales management and current signals from stores. This enables activities to be planned more precisely, implemented more consistently and evaluated more quickly."
    },
    {
     "role": "eyebrow",
     "order": 3,
     "text": "Case Study"
    },
    {
     "role": "cta",
     "order": 4,
     "text": "Gerolsteiner lays the foundation for personalized customer engagement",
     "href": "https://www.reply.com/4brands-reply/en/gerolsteiner-personalized-customer-communication"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 5,
     "text": "By integrating its app, website, and online shop, the mineral water brand is systematically expanding its digital consumer dialogue."
    },
    {
     "role": "eyebrow",
     "order": 6,
     "text": "Case Study"
    },
    {
     "role": "cta",
     "order": 7,
     "text": "Bitburger: Gamification as the key to data-driven marketing",
     "href": "/en/cx-and-digital-commerce/bitburger-gamification-as-the-key-to-data-driven-marketing"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 8,
     "text": "With a creative summer campaign, one of Germany’s most renowned beer brands has found a way to turn emotional engagement into strategic insight, combining memorable experiences with valuable data on consumer behavior and brand loyalty."
    },
    {
     "role": "eyebrow",
     "order": 9,
     "text": "Case Study"
    },
    {
     "role": "cta",
     "order": 10,
     "text": "Bitburger creates a unique and personalized brand experience",
     "href": "https://www.reply.com/en/cx-and-digital-commerce/bitburger-personalizes-marketing"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 11,
     "text": "During the European Football Championship, the Bitburger brewery group is relying on a comprehensive omnichannel campaign that focuses on direct contact with fans. This is made possible by a pioneering solution from 4brands Reply."
    },
    {
     "role": "eyebrow",
     "order": 12,
     "text": "Case Study"
    },
    {
     "role": "cta",
     "order": 13,
     "text": "A seamless sales system for Ritter Sport",
     "href": "https://www.reply.com/en/cloud-computing/a-seamless-sales-system-for-ritter-sport"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 14,
     "text": "In-keeping with the well-known slogan “Quality in a Square\", the family-owned company, together with 4brands Reply, is setting its sights on digital and future-oriented sales with the SAP Sales Cloud."
    },
    {
     "role": "eyebrow",
     "order": 15,
     "text": "Case Study"
    },
    {
     "role": "cta",
     "order": 16,
     "text": "Rotkaeppchen-Mumm Sektkellereien: fit for the future with Reply",
     "href": "/4brands-reply/en/rotkaeppchen-mumm-sektkellereien"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 17,
     "text": "The elegant bottles in the sparkling wine cellars of Rotkaeppchen-Mumm Sektkellereien represent a unique success story for the leader in the German sparkling wine market. To help maintain its position, the company has replaced its previous CRM solution with the leading consumer goods customer management and mobility software platform implemented by 4brands Reply."
    },
    {
     "role": "eyebrow",
     "order": 18,
     "text": "Case Study"
    },
    {
     "role": "cta",
     "order": 19,
     "text": "With 4brands Reply, Zentis streamlines pricing models to enhance sales and financial functions",
     "href": "/4brands-reply/en/price-and-condition-management-zentis"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 20,
     "text": "Zentis achieves automation and transparency to better calculate pricing models for customers. Complex pricing models were creating excessive work and complexity for the sales and account teams at Zentis, driving it to identify an optimised IT solution. SAP Business Warehouse provides a homogeneous database that simulates conditional scenarios to support Zentis in..."
    },
    {
     "role": "eyebrow",
     "order": 21,
     "text": "Case Study"
    },
    {
     "role": "cta",
     "order": 22,
     "text": "Avoiding production bottlenecks",
     "href": "/4brands-reply/en/avoiding-production-bottlenecks"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 23,
     "text": "For Peter Kölln GmbH & Co. KGaA an inaccurate raw material planning is now a thing of the past. 4brands Reply has developed for the former Köllnflockenwerke a smart solution for multi-stage production planning based on SAP APO."
    }
   ],
