    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 5,
     "text": "The PAC RADAR recognizes Reply as ‘Best in Class’ in Europe for ‘SAP Business AI and Joule-related Services’ and ‘SAP Consulting & Systems Integration,’ confirming our proven expertise in driving the intelligent enterprise."
    },
    {
     "role": "eyebrow",
     "order": 6,
     "text": "News"
    },
    {
     "role": "cta",
     "order": 7,
     "text": "Reply Recognized in SAP Services Landscape Report",
     "href": "/en/newsroom/news/reply-recognized-in-sap-services-landscape-report"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 8,
     "text": "Reply is proud to announce its recognition in Forrester’s SAP Services Landscape."
    },
    {
     "role": "eyebrow",
     "order": 9,
     "text": "Research"
    },
    {
     "role": "cta",
     "order": 10,
     "text": "Top ranking for Reply in SAP-related services",
     "href": "https://www.reply.com/en/cloud-computing/leading-provider-of-sap-services"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 11,
     "text": "The PAC RADAR by teknowlogy is a tool for holistic evaluation and visual positioning of software and ICT service providers on local markets. The PAC RADAR \"Leading Providers of SAP Services in Germany 2022\" rates Reply as \"Best in Class\" provider for SAP CX-related services and as \"Excellent\" for SAP S/4 HANA-related services."
    },
    {
     "role": "eyebrow",
     "order": 12,
     "text": "Offering"
    },
    {
     "role": "cta",
     "order": 13,
     "text": "Our app on SAP® Store",
