    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 14,
     "text": "Raise sales potential with real-time perfect store analytics & on-demand retail execution with smartREX. The FMCG-tailored solution from 4brands Reply is now available on SAP® Store, the online marketplace for SAP and partner offerings."
    }
